comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:30:26.978Z",codex-searxng-agent,"All 55 records, 622 history entries by integrity census, 137 graph edges, deep canonical plans, all statuses, exact/fuzzy duplicate audits, package surfaces, current upstream source/docs, live route behavior, and repository command contracts were inspected before creation. No open work or duplicate terminal item covers this new route-parity and uniform-format delta."
  "2026-07-25T22:45:35.186Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Implementation checkpoint: fourteen typed instance resource/view contracts are available in TOON JSON and raw output with provenance and file capture. Hermetic installed E2E passes. Governed LAN isolated-package E2E passed after removing only the disposable /tmp/pm-cli-node-compile-cache-1000 directory that had exhausted tmpfs inodes; the first failure occurred during output capture before any product assertion."
  "2026-07-25T23:13:10.234Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Full seven-command PM-linked acceptance matrix passes after two harness hardenings: the E2E cache proof clears its isolated cache before the exact-hit assertion, and duplication output retains strict 2.93 percent threshold evidence plus the complete JSON report while bounding console capture. pm-cli 2026.7.25 reproduced closed GH-679's EAGAIN defect before that output optimization; detailed duplicate search confirmed it as a fixed-release regression and GH-714 was filed: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/714."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:30:26.978Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Search formats may be disabled by the instance: keep JSON-first then HTML fallback. Stable metadata/resources are read-only; do not add administrative mutations or leak live payloads into PM/GitHub."
  "2026-07-25T22:48:32.291Z",codex-searxng-agent,The canonical feature-parity plan is closed and cannot be the parent of active continuation work under tracker validation. This item remains deep-linked to it as related lineage instead.
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:30:26.978Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Command help is a contract test: a global flag listed for every command must be routed through every command family, not merely accepted by the shared parser."
  "2026-07-25T23:13:10.234Z",codex-searxng-agent,Machine-readable reports should remain complete while routine agent and CI stdout stays bounded; this preserves strict gates and prevents evidence transport from becoming the failure source.
