plan_mode: executing
plan_scope: "Read-only SearXNG route parity, uniform command formatting/help, current toolchain, and release delivery"
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Fresh branch after all-status PM and upstream/live gap analysis. Implement stable read-only resource commands (health/config/descriptions/stats/errors/opensearch/manifest/robots), truthful TOON/JSON/global-format behavior and command help; upgrade local pm-cli plus pm-changelog; then run full 100 percent, live installed, PR bot, merge, and release gates."
plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  Complete delivery gates,"bun run quality; bun audit; bun run security:trivy; bun run smoke:package; live isolated searxng route/format/cache/setup acceptance; pm test; release dry run; exact-head CI/review inventory","100/100/100/100, all typed route/format schemas, governed LAN and isolated installed executable proof, zero PM/security/review findings, green merged head"
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-25T22:30:50.337Z",codex-searxng-agent,Add typed read-only instance-resource commands and make output/global-flag behavior uniform; do not model mutating UI/admin routes as CLI parity.,"Stable GET resources are useful and safe for agents, while search already has complete typed plus raw parameter passthrough and the instance does not expose an administrative API contract.",Official webapp.py route inventory at upstream 0909dbc9; live 2026.7.24 responses; current source route coverage.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:30:51.301Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Upstream master is two workflow-only commits ahead of the governed service commit, @toon-format/toon remains 4.0.0, global pm-cli is latest 2026.7.25, repo-local pm-cli and pm-changelog need 2026.7.25 refresh, and the workstation searxng executable is stale 2026.7.23 despite npm latest 2026.7.25."
