body: "Canonical continuation of the closed feature-parity and operational-parity plans. The governed service is http://192.168.1.183:38522 at SearXNG 2026.7.24+4f64d9501. Upstream master 0909dbc9 differs only by two workflow dependency commits, so the product delta is stable route coverage and consistent command contracts. Preserve JSON-first/HTML fallback for search, unrestricted raw SearXNG parameters, TOON v4 default, setup wizard, all state under ~/.searxng-cli, unlimited cache persistence, and daily release invariants. Never record private settings or raw live payloads."
